WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.437 --> 00:00:03.410
Unit nineteen. Part-Time Jobs!

2
00:00:04.365 --> 00:00:10.802
Hello, everyone! I'm Teacher Vibol. Welcome to Secondary English, Level three!

3
00:00:10.852 --> 00:00:14.323
Hi, Teacher Vibol! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:14.373 --> 00:00:18.030
Today we learn: Part-Time Jobs. Let's go!

5
00:00:19.468 --> 00:00:23.802
Part-time job. Say it with me. Part-time job!

6
00:00:27.300 --> 00:00:31.000
Employer. Say it with me. Employer!

7
00:00:34.541 --> 00:00:38.091
Wage. Say it with me. Wage!

8
00:00:41.557 --> 00:00:46.107
Responsibility. Say it with me. Responsibility!

9
00:00:49.571 --> 00:00:53.404
Experience. Say it with me. Experience!

10
00:00:56.977 --> 00:01:00.794
Schedule. Say it with me. Schedule!

11
00:01:04.245 --> 00:01:07.495
Shift. Say it with me. Shift!

12
00:01:10.971 --> 00:01:14.304
Skill. Say it with me. Skill!

13
00:01:17.848 --> 00:01:27.449
Grammar time! Modal 'could' for possibility. Listen. A part-time job could teach you responsibility.

14
00:01:27.499 --> 00:01:33.129
Your turn. Say it with me. A part-time job could teach you responsibility.

15
00:01:38.142 --> 00:01:48.704
Having a part-time job teaches responsibility and gives you real work experience. You learn to manage your schedule around your work shift and earn a wage while learning new skills.

16
00:01:48.754 --> 00:01:50.074
I like this story!

17
00:01:51.269 --> 00:01:56.430
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:56.480 --> 00:01:57.630
Wage!

19
00:01:58.427 --> 00:02:03.711
Look! What's the word?

20
00:02:03.761 --> 00:02:04.911
Shift!

21
00:02:05.891 --> 00:02:14.703
Think and answer. What skills do you think a part-time job could teach you?

22
00:02:14.753 --> 00:02:15.903
Great answer!

23
00:02:17.229 --> 00:02:19.735
This unit's value is Responsibility.

24
00:02:19.785 --> 00:02:22.401
I can show responsibility every day!

25
00:02:23.543 --> 00:02:31.489
Congratulations, everyone! You finished Secondary Level three. See you in Level four. Goodbye!

26
00:02:31.539 --> 00:02:35.280
Thank you, Teacher Vibol! See you in Level 4!

